``` SOC-RULE-048: AWS Canary Credential Used (generated from rules/sigma/cloud_aws_canary_credential_use.yml; review before use) ```
index=* (source="*aws:cloudtrail*") | where (((match('userIdentity.userName', "(?i)^canary\\-backup\\-reader$") OR match('userIdentity.userName', "(?i)^canary\\-ci\\-deployer$"))))
